WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.534 --> 00:00:16.769
Skyler: We found Sarah's tooth at Riley's house!

2
00:00:16.770 --> 00:00:19.356
Theo: But how did it get there?

3
00:00:19.357 --> 00:00:21.391
Ben: I have no idea!

4
00:00:21.392 --> 00:00:26.979
But maybe it happened when we bumped into each other.

5
00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:28.723
Sarah: What do you mean?

6
00:00:28.724 --> 00:00:30.649
Where's my tooth?

7
00:00:30.650 --> 00:00:34.288
Theo: You won't believe this, but . . .

8
00:00:34.289 --> 00:00:37.578
Riley: We gave it to the Dog Tooth Fairy!

9
00:00:37.579 --> 00:00:41.838
Sarah: The Dog Tooth Fairy!

10
00:00:41.839 --> 00:00:48.977
Skyler: Yes. We found a tooth on Riley's porch.

11
00:00:48.978 --> 00:00:52.491
Theo: We thought it belonged to Snooks.

12
00:00:52.492 --> 00:00:57.680
Riley: So we left it for the Dog Tooth Fairy.

13
00:00:57.681 --> 00:01:00.939
Ben: And the Dog Tooth Fairy took it!

14
00:01:00.940 --> 00:01:03.509
Sarah: But how can I get it back?

15
00:01:03.510 --> 00:01:06.766
Theo: That's a good question.

16
00:01:06.767 --> 00:01:14.203
Riley: Let's ask my mom after school.

17
00:01:14.204 --> 00:01:18.114
Riley: Mom, we made a big mistake!

18
00:01:18.115 --> 00:01:20.513
Mrs. Summers: What happened?

19
00:01:20.514 --> 00:01:26.533
Theo: We gave Sarah's tooth to the Dog Tooth Fairy.

20
00:01:26.534 --> 00:01:30.332
Mrs. Summers: Oh, dear. That is a problem.

21
00:01:30.333 --> 00:01:33.405
Ben: What can we do now?

22
00:01:33.406 --> 00:01:36.653
Mrs. Summers: You could write another letter to the Dog Tooth Fairy.

23
00:01:36.654 --> 00:01:39.230
Mrs. Summers: Maybe she'll give it back.

24
00:01:39.231 --> 00:01:44.619
Sarah: What if the Dog Tooth Fairy threw away the tooth?

25
00:01:44.620 --> 00:01:54.880
Skyler: That would be awful!

26
00:01:54.881 --> 00:01:57.467
Theo: We're finished with the note.

27
00:01:57.468 --> 00:02:01.044
Riley: We'll leave it on Snooks' pillow tonight.

28
00:02:01.045 --> 00:02:04.559
Sarah: When will I get my tooth back?

29
00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:06.607
Mrs. Summers: Don't worry, Sarah.

30
00:02:06.608 --> 00:02:12.776
Everything will happen at the right time.
